{title: Shout Hosanna}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

>Lyrics

Verse 1

Shout Hosanna, Shout Hosanna!

Shout Hosanna, Shout Hosanna!

Blessed is He who comes in the name,

Singing, blessed is He who comes in the name

Of the Lord.

Chorus

Shout Hosanna in the highest.

(Bring your praises to the Lord).

He is coming to redeem us.

(By the power of His Word).

Shout Hosanna as we welcome the Lord.

Verse 2

Shout Hosanna, Shout Hosanna!

Shout Hosanna, Shout Hosanna!

Lift up your voices, and join in the song

To the One in whose grace we now live and belong

He is King!

(Repeat Chorus)

Shout Hosanna in the highest.

(Bring your praises to the Lord).

He is coming to redeem us.

(By the power of His Word).

Shout Hosanna as we welcome the Lord.

Verse 3

Shout Hosanna, Shout Hosanna!

Shout Hosanna, Shout Hosanna!

Come to the table and sup with the Lord.

With abundant rejoicing we'll drink from His Word.

He is life!

(Repeat Chorus)

Shout Hosanna in the highest.

(Bring your praises to the Lord).

He is coming to redeem us.

(By the power of His Word).

Shout Hosanna as we welcome the Lord.

Shout Hosanna!
